{"k":{"t01-apar-0":"<span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"12.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">VYSVĚTLUJÍCÍ KNÍŽKA</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"8.4pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">K</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Delmasovým pomocným tabulkám</span> <span class=\"orn\">❦</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"13.2pt\" data-rolo=\"serio\">PRVNÍ SÉRIE</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-apar-1":"<span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.0pt\" data-rolo=\"nom\">TABULKA č. 1</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"11.4pt\" data-rolo=\"tit\">Škola. — Lyceum. — Třída.</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-tit-1":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Obecný popis.</span>","t01-01-1":"1. — Tato tabulka znázorňuje <b>třídu</b> v <b>lyceu</b>. V této třídě je osm <b>stolů</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.339325,0.560105,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"18\" title=\"stolů\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(18)</sup></button> a osm <b>lavic</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.298491,0.886341,0.009543,0.012447\" data-n=\"32\" title=\"lavic\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(32)</sup></button>. Na každé lavici sedí tři žáci. <b>Učitel</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.104527,0.503767,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"7\" title=\"Učitel\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(7)</sup></button> sedí na <b>židli</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.072792,0.542745,0.00466,0.012119\" data-n=\"8\" title=\"židli\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(8)</sup></button> u své <b>katedry</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.134043,0.602358,0.00466,0.011137\" data-n=\"6\" title=\"katedry\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(6)</sup></button>.","t01-02-1":"2. — Vlevo od katedry je <b>prosklená skříň</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"prosklená skříň\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button>. Vpravo je <b>černá tabule</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.016644,0.59679,0.003329,0.010481\" data-n=\"1\" title=\"černá tabule\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(1)</sup></button> se svým <b>hadrem</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.034842,0.685228,0.005548,0.010154\" data-n=\"2\" title=\"hadrem\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(2)</sup></button> a <b>křídou</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.055704,0.744186,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"3\" title=\"křídou\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(3)</sup></button>.","t01-02-2":"Nad katedrou visí <b>nástěnné tabule</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.042166,0.4887,0.00466,0.010481\" data-n=\"9\" title=\"nástěnné tabule\" aria-expanded=\"false\">9</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"nástěnné tabule\" aria-expanded=\"false\">11</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"nástěnné tabule\" aria-expanded=\"false\">12</button>)</sup> a <b>mapa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.117843,0.250901,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"10\" title=\"mapa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(10)</sup></button>.","t01-03-1":"3. — Ne všichni žáci sedí na svém <b>místě</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.290945,0.528005,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"17\" title=\"místě\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(17)</sup></button>. Jan <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.006658,0.712414,0.00577,0.010481\" data-n=\"4\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(4)</sup></button> stojí u tabule; drží <b>ten</b> hadr a maže <b>geometrické obrazce.</b>","t01-03-2":"Petr je u katedry; sbírá <b>písemné úkoly</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.092543,0.64756,0.005104,0.010809\" data-n=\"5\" title=\"písemné úkoly\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(5)</sup></button> a nese je učiteli.","t01-04-1":"4. — <b>Tento</b> učitel je učitelem <b>živých jazyků.</b> Učí žáky mluvit, číst a psát cizími jazyky <b>(německy, anglicky, španělsky, italsky, rusky</b> nebo <b>francouzsky)</b>.","t01-05-1":"5. — Třída je velmi prostorná a velmi světlá. Vzadu je široké <b>okno</b> se dvěma <b>okenicemi</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.336662,0.236489,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"78\" title=\"okenicemi\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(78)</sup></button> a <b>prosklené dveře,</b> aby se dala větrat a osvětlovat.","t01-05-2":"V této třídě není zima. Uprostřed stojí, aby ji vytápěla, velmi dobrá <b>kamna</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543054,0.73567,0.011984,0.010809\" data-n=\"46\" title=\"kamna\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(46)</sup></button> se svou <b>rourou</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.506214,0.622666,0.010431,0.011464\" data-n=\"45\" title=\"rourou\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(45)</sup></button>.","t01-05-3":"Na stěně jsou připevněné <b>věšáky</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.908566,0.720275,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"58\" title=\"věšáky\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(58)</sup></button>; visí na nich čepice a pláště školáků.","t01-tit-2":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Školní dvůr.</span>","t01-06-1":"6. — <b>Hodiny</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.781846,0.21225,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"63\" title=\"Hodiny\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(63)</sup></button> ukazují devět hodin a pět minut.","t01-06-2":"<b>Přestávka</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.38016,0.384212,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"76\" title=\"Přestávka\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(76)</sup></button> právě skončila a vyučování začíná znovu. Přestávka se koná na <b>dvoře</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.36285,0.442516,0.008655,0.010154\" data-n=\"75\" title=\"dvoře\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(75)</sup></button>. Vidíme několik žáků, kteří si hrají. <b>Dozorce</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.419441,0.372093,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"74\" title=\"Dozorce\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(74)</sup></button> na ně dohlíží.","t01-07-1":"7. — Na dvoře vidíme ještě různé osoby, totiž <b>inspektora</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.400355,0.432689,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"73\" title=\"inspektora\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(73)</sup></button>, <b>ředitele</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.47692,0.431379,0.008655,0.010809\" data-n=\"71\" title=\"ředitele\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(71)</sup></button> a <b>cenzora</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.441411,0.428431,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"72\" title=\"cenzora\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(72)</sup></button>.","t01-07-2":"Inspektor kontroluje školy, ředitel řídí lyceum, cenzor dohlíží na studium.","t01-07-3":"Čtvrtou osobou je <b>vrátný</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.33644,0.429414,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"77\" title=\"vrátný\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(77)</sup></button>. Nese pod paží knihu, aby zapsal nepřítomné.","t01-08-1":"8. — Vzadu na dvoře je <b>tělocvičné nářadí</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.467599,0.393384,0.009543,0.009826\" data-n=\"70\" title=\"tělocvičné nářadí\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(70)</sup></button> a dílna pro <b>ruční práce</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"ruční práce\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button>.","t01-08-2":"Vpravo od tabulky zahlédneme <b>učebny</b> <b>hudby</b> a <b>kreslení</b>.","t01-tit-3":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Podrobný popis.</span>","t01-tit-4":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Dobří žáci.</span>","t01-09-1":"9. — Žáci v první lavici vpravo od katedry jsou <b>Jindřich</b> <button class=\"apel\" data-noto=\"cs-t01-noto-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\">(*)</button>, <b>Štěpán</b> a <b>Karel.</b>","t01-09-2":"Jindřich je velmi pozorný a pracovitý; poslouchá učitele. Na svém stole má <b>sešit</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230581,0.868981,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"28\" title=\"sešit\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(28)</sup></button>, <b>knihu</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.199068,0.863085,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"29\" title=\"knihu\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(29)</sup></button>, <b>slovník</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.159565,0.891582,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"30\" title=\"slovník\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(30)</sup></button> a <b>penál</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.214603,0.905011,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"31\" title=\"penál\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(31)</sup></button>. Jeho kniha má mnoho <b>stran</b>; každá kapitola obsahuje několik <b>odstavců</b> a každý <b>řádek</b> mnoho <b>slov.</b>","t01-09-4":"Jeho soused Štěpán <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.291389,0.81035,0.012206,0.010154\" data-n=\"24\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(24)</sup></button> je horlivý. Zapisuje si do sešitu úkol na příště. Má krásné <b>písmo.</b> Jeho kniha je zavřená. Vidíme jen <b>desky</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.201287,0.804455,0.010431,0.010809\" data-n=\"27\" title=\"desky\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(27)</sup></button>. Vedle něho leží jeho <b>kružítko</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.21771,0.820832,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"26\" title=\"kružítko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(26)</sup></button>.","t01-09-5":"Karel <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.270084,0.730102,0.009987,0.011137\" data-n=\"23\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(23)</sup></button> drží knihu v ruce; otevírá ji, aby si ještě jednou přečetl úkol. Má, jako každý žák, před sebou <b>kalamář</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.241456,0.717982,0.011318,0.009826\" data-n=\"25\" title=\"kalamář\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(25)</sup></button>. Je poslušný.","t01-10-1":"10. — U vedlejšího stolu sedí <b>Ludvík, Antonín</b> a <b>Pavel.</b> Ludvík odříkává svou <b>lekci</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.365291,0.645922,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"22\" title=\"lekci\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(22)</sup></button> a odpovídá na <b>otázky</b> učitele. Antonín <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.329117,0.630855,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"21\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(21)</sup></button> je velmi nepozorný; někdy ho učitel dokonce potrestá. Pavel <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.334665,0.600721,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"20\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(20)</sup></button> je dobrý <b>kamarád,</b> laskavý a ochotný. Je velmi pozorný.","t01-tit-5":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Špatní žáci.</span>","t01-11-1":"11. — Za Jindřichem sedí <b>Jiří</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543276,0.87455,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"38\" title=\"Jiří\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(38)</sup></button>. Není to špatný chlapec, ale je <b>upovídaný,</b> nepozorný a neposedný. Jeho <b>lehkomyslnost</b> a jeho <b>neposlušnost</b> působí <b>zmatek</b> při vyučování a často si zaslouží přísné <b>napomenutí.</b> Jeho <b>sešit na koncepty</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.486906,0.885686,0.009987,0.010809\" data-n=\"35\" title=\"sešit na koncepty\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(35)</sup></button> je špinavý; <b>dělá na něj inkoustové skvrny</b> svým <b>perem</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.513316,0.936456,0.011762,0.008516\" data-n=\"34\" title=\"perem\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(34)</sup></button>, a proto stále používá svou <b>gumu</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.478695,0.859155,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"36\" title=\"gumu\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(36)</sup></button>; jeho <b>aktovka</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.454949,0.912217,0.010431,0.012119\" data-n=\"33\" title=\"aktovka\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(33)</sup></button> je roztržená, tak je nedbalý. Proč si nosí své <b>plnicí pero</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.496671,0.864723,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"37\" title=\"plnicí pero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(37)</sup></button> do třídy <b>živých</b> jazyků?","t01-11-2":"Jeho soused Edmund <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.53573,0.800852,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"39\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(39)</sup></button> ho nemá rád. Je sice poněkud lenivý, ale je mlčenlivý a klidný. Nežvaní; místo aby poslouchal, čte raději <b>povídky</b> ve své <b>čítance</b>.","t01-11-3":"Třetím žákem v této lavici je <b>Ludvík</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.483577,0.767114,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"40\" title=\"Ludvík\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(40)</sup></button>. Je pilný. Píše na bílý <b>list papíru.</b> Před sebe si položil <b>savý papír</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.432091,0.739928,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"41\" title=\"savý papír\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(41)</sup></button>.","t01-12-1":"12. — Žáci ve druhé lavici, vlevo od učitele, jsou velmi mladí. První, malý <b>Emil,</b> ještě neumí příliš dobře psát; nosí si svou <b>břidlicovou tabulku</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.45162,0.655421,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"42\" title=\"břidlicovou tabulku\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(42)</sup></button>, své <b>pisátko</b> a svou <b>houbičku</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.627252,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"43\" title=\"houbičku\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(43)</sup></button>.","t01-12-2":"Vedle něho jsou <b>August</b> a <b>Bernard</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.591549,0.011984,0.009499\" data-n=\"44\" title=\"Bernard\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(44)</sup></button>. Tento poslední pracuje dobře, ale jeho <b>oblečení</b> je velmi zanedbané.","t01-13-1":"13. — Za nimi sedí tři <b>lenoši. Albert</b> se neučí svým lekcím. <b>Jakub</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.629161,0.611857,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"47\" title=\"Jakub\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(47)</sup></button> spí místo toho, aby poslouchal. Jeho <b>lenost</b> mu vynáší <b>výtky</b> a dokonce <b>tresty.</b> Konečně <b>Kristián</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.679982,0.61153,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"48\" title=\"Kristián\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(48)</sup></button> je příliš lehkovážný. <b>Chová</b> se špatně a nijak se nesnaží polepšit.","t01-14-1":"14. — Jeho sousedé se naopak chovají dobře. <b>Arnošt</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699956,0.702588,0.007989,0.010809\" data-n=\"51\" title=\"Arnošt\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(51)</sup></button> má rád pořádek a přesnost; stále používá své <b>pravítko</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.692632,0.793318,0.008877,0.010809\" data-n=\"50\" title=\"pravítko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(50)</sup></button> a svou <b>tužku</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.671993,0.744841,0.010209,0.009171\" data-n=\"49\" title=\"tužku\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(49)</sup></button>. Je <b>externí žák.</b>","t01-14-2":"<b>František</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.780293,0.754012,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"52\" title=\"František\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(52)</sup></button> je <b>internátní žák</b>; nosí uniformu, jí a spí v lyceu. Je dobrý <b>kamarád.</b>","t01-14-3":"Mořic si ořezává svou <b>tužku</b> svým <b>nožíkem</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.786951,0.886341,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"56\" title=\"nožíkem\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(56)</sup></button>; je velmi pečlivý.","t01-14-4":"Nosí si všechny své knihy, svou <b>mluvnici</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.732801,0.892892,0.009543,0.010481\" data-n=\"55\" title=\"mluvnici\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(55)</sup></button>, svůj <b>zápisník</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.709055,0.857845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"54\" title=\"zápisník\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(54)</sup></button> a dokonce i <b>psací podložku</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.762761,0.880118,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"53\" title=\"psací podložku\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(53)</sup></button>. Jeho <b>školní brašna</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.930537,0.91451,0.010209,0.010809\" data-n=\"57\" title=\"školní brašna\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(57)</sup></button> leží na zemi za ním.","t01-14-5":"Oba stoly vzadu ve třídě zaujímají <b>dobří žáci</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.337772,0.507042,0.008433,0.010809\" data-n=\"19\" title=\"dobří žáci\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(19)</sup></button>.","t01-tit-6":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Kreslení a hudba.</span>","t01-15-1":"15. — V <b>kreslírně</b> visí na stěně půvabné <b>předlohy</b> a od stropu je zavěšena <b>lampa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.975144,0.45922,0.009765,0.010809\" data-n=\"62\" title=\"lampa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(62)</sup></button> se svým <b>stínítkem</b>. <b>Učitel</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.81447,0.575827,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"60\" title=\"Učitel\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(60)</sup></button> je velmi trpělivý; opravuje <b>kresby</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.891034,0.610219,0.007324,0.009826\" data-n=\"61\" title=\"kresby\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(61)</sup></button> žáků a učí je kreslit <b>bustu</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.976476,0.514248,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"59\" title=\"bustu\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(59)</sup></button> podle přírody.","t01-16-1":"16. — <b>Hudební učebna</b> se zdá velmi zajímavá. Učí se v ní číst <b>noty,</b> zpívat podle not <b>tóny stupnice</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.753884,0.423845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"67\" title=\"tóny stupnice\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(67)</sup></button> zapsané na <b>osnově</b> (do, re, mi, fa, sol, la, si = C. D. E. F. G. A. B.), poznávat <b>klíče</b> a zpívat půvabné <b>melodie.</b> Noty se kladou na <b>pultík</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.640257,0.466099,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"65\" title=\"pultík\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(65)</sup></button>. Jeden ze žáků <b>hraje na klavír</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.758766,0.510645,0.010652,0.010809\" data-n=\"64\" title=\"hraje na klavír\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(64)</sup></button> a <b>učitel hudby</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699512,0.461513,0.009099,0.010809\" data-n=\"66\" title=\"učitel hudby\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(66)</sup></button> <b>udává takt</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.725477,0.447101,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"68\" title=\"udává takt\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(68)</sup></button>.","t01-17-1":"17. — Zahlédneme kout dílny pro <b>ruční práce</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"ruční práce\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button>, kde se chlapci mohou naučit hoblovat dřevo a pilovat železo. To není v každém lyceu.","t01-tit-7":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Učebna přírodních věd.</span>","t01-18-1":"18. — Učitel matematiky učí <b>žáky</b> <b>geometrii, počtům, počítání</b> a <b>metrické soustavě</b>. Na tabulce vidíme hlavní geometrické obrazce: <b>kruh</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.019633,0.658661,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"kruh\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, <b>čtverec</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052468,0.626557,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"čtverec\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, <b>trojúhelník</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.049811,0.67077,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"trojúhelník\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button>, <b>přímku</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.035173,0.739874,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"přímku\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-18-2":"Vidíme také jeden <b>příklad;</b> není to <b>sčítání,</b> ani <b>odčítání,</b> ani <b>násobení</b>: je to opravdu <b>dělení</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.065565,0.676005,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"dělení\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>.","t01-19-1":"19. — Na tabulce metrické soustavy vidíme: <b>metr</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052217,0.380286,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"metr\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, <b>váhy</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.015161,0.379639,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"váhy\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button> a jejich <b>závaží,</b> <b>litr</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.059978,0.343932,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"litr\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, <b>dekalitr</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.013372,0.258796,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"dekalitr\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, <b>decilitr</b> a <b>krychlový metr</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.03224,0.324944,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"krychlový metr\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-19-2":"Žáci studují také <b>přírodopis</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"nástěnné tabule\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(11)</sup></button>, zoologii <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.124098,0.290533,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"zoologii\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, botaniku <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.132317,0.3652,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"botaniku\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, geologii <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.127443,0.431354,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"geologii\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button>, a <b>dějepis</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"nástěnné tabule\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(12)</sup></button>.","t01-19-3":"Ve skříni jsou přístroje pro <b>fyziku</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"prosklená skříň\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button> a pro <b>chemii</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230138,0.5755,0.009321,0.010481\" data-n=\"16\" title=\"chemii\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(16)</sup></button>.","t01-19-4":"Na skříni jsou: <b>koule</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.189525,0.419915,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"14\" title=\"koule\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(14)</sup></button>, <b>kužel</b> a <b>zeměkoule</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.175322,0.387815,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"13\" title=\"zeměkoule\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(13)</sup></button>.","t01-19-5":"Nad tabulkami visí <b>mapa</b> znázorňující pět dílů světa: <b>Evropu</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.161802,0.143808,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"Evropu\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, <b>Asii</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.20951,0.166394,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"g\" title=\"Asii\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(g)</sup></button>, <b>Afriku</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.155821,0.230267,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"Afriku\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, <b>Ameriku</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.073486,0.101258,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"Ameriku\" aria-expanded=\"false\">a</button><button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.084585,0.148741,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"Ameriku\" aria-expanded=\"false\">b</button>)</sup> a <b>Oceánii</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.209077,0.256781,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"h\" title=\"Oceánii\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(h)</sup></button>, a oba velké oceány, <b>Tichý</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.036213,0.146461,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"Tichý\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> a <b>Atlantský</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.116538,0.161832,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"Atlantský\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>. <span class=\"fil\"></span>"},"noto":{"t01-noto-1":"(*) U <i>křestních jmen</i> se rovněž doporučuje přepisovat je podle latinského tvaru. Je to jediný způsob, jak uniknout nesčetným obměnám. Ostatně jak vybrat mezi <i>Giovanni, Jean, Johann, Jan, Hans, John, Ivan</i> atd.? Vytvoříme snad zvláštní slovník křestních jmen? Vezměme si z latiny jejich nominativ a řekněme: <b>Ioannes, Ioanna; Iulius, Iulia; Iakobus; Andreas; Lukas.</b> (Úplná mluvnice)."}}
